"Every document this analysis is built on. Nothing here is private or paid for. 25 came from the Town by records request and are marked; the rest were published by the district, the town, the state or a neighboring district. 6 of them are no longer open at the address their publisher used \u2014 checked 29 August 2026, and all but a handful were Google Drive links that now ask for a sign-in. Our copies stay open, and every row carries a sha256 so anyone who still has access can check them against the originals. Where a document was unreadable, or says something inconvenient, it is listed anyway."